# The models the no-mistakes pipeline runs on, for every dev-system workspace.
#
# The single source of truth: edit here, merge to main, and every workspace
# picks it up on its next start - dev-init fetches this file from main
# (DEV_MODELS_URL) and rewrites the managed model pin in the global no-mistakes
# config from it, with no release or image rebuild. The image's baked copy is
# the offline fallback. Env DEV_CODEX_MODEL / DEV_CLAUDE_MODEL override both.
# The deprecated callum-tools feature's codexModel default must match
# CODEX_MODEL (npm test checks it).
#
# Format: KEY=value lines, # comments and blank lines only. It is parsed, never
# sourced (images/base/models.sh): unknown keys are ignored, and a value must
# match [A-Za-z0-9._:/-]+ - no quotes, spaces or shell syntax.

# codex, the pipeline's first agent.
CODEX_MODEL=gpt-6.1-sol
# claude, the fallback agent.
CLAUDE_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
